-STATISTIC S (identical to the calibration definition)
-- Reference corpus for confinement: all herbal pages of the SAME Currier language as the page.
-- A page-confined recurring type on page p: count on p >= 2 and count on p / count in the reference corpus >= 0.9.
-- For each page: if it has at least one such type, take the one whose first occurrence is earliest; hit = that occurrence lies in line 1 of the page.
-- S = hits / number of pages (all pages in the denominator).
-- Reported for: pooled herbal (primary), Herbal A only, Herbal B only.
-
-NULLS (1,000 draws each; seed 20261019; p = (1 + #null >= obs) / 1001; q99 = 99th percentile)
-- N2 (DECISIVE). Three slot classes per page: paragraph-initial, line-initial, other.
-  Paragraph-initial tokens are permuted among the paragraph-initial slots of all pages in the same stratum
-  (quire x sheet x hand x Currier language). Where a sheet mixes hands or languages, swaps happen only between pages sharing both.
-  Line-initial tokens are permuted among line-initial slots within the page; other tokens among other slots within the page.
-  Line lengths and paragraph structure are kept. If more than 25% of herbal pages fall in single-page strata, the stratum is widened
