-
-PRIMARY CALL (ZL3b, whole words, pooled herbal)
-- NAME_SLOT_PRESENT if G1 PASS and S > N2 q99 and S >= 0.12 (the Macer-Egerton band floor) and LOQO criterion holds.
-- RARITY_ONLY if G1 PASS and S > N1 q99 but S <= N2 q99.
-- ABSENT if G1 PASS and S <= N1 q99.
-- NOT_POWERED if G1 fails.
-- Any other combination prints MIXED with the values.
